## Bundled Software

The release archive (`dist/steamapp-verlock.star`) contains only Steam App Verlock's own
Lua backend, compiled frontend, and plugin metadata. It bundles no third-party library: the
frontend imports React, React DOM, and the Millennium SDK from host globals, and the backend
runs on Millennium's host modules. Compiler-generated helper snippets, if any, come from
Starlight's Oxc-based toolchain (MIT), listed below.

## Host-Provided Components

These components are loaded from the Steam client or Millennium at runtime and are not part
of any distribution. They are listed for completeness.

- Millennium, supplied by the host for the plugin framework, the Lua host, and the `fs`,
  `utils`, `logger`, and `json` backend modules, is available under the MIT License. For
  details, see <https://github.com/SteamClientHomebrew/Millennium>.
- React, supplied by the Steam client for the frontend UI library, is available under the
  MIT License. For details, see <https://github.com/facebook/react>.
- React DOM, supplied by the Steam client for the frontend renderer, is available under the
  MIT License. For details, see <https://github.com/facebook/react>.

